{"url": "https://netpmd.com/careers","title":"Careers | NetPMD","markdown":"[Skip to Content](#page)\n\n[NetPMD Design and Integration](/) \n\n[Home](/)\n\n[About](/about)\n\n[Services](#)\n\n[Design Services](/design-services)\n\n[Program Management](/program-management)\n\n[Integration Services](/integration-services)\n\n[Wireless Services](/wireless-services)\n\n[Careers](/careers)\n\n[Contact](/contact)\n\n# Careers\n\nNetPMD is looking for career-focused individuals to join our team. We are continuously growing and expanding our portfolio of clients in the ISP, CLECs, ILECs, and MSOs. Our company's primary focus is to partner with our clients and help them be successful in their design and construction goals through high quality deliverables.\n\n## Fiber Optic Designer\n\n#### OSP Design\n\n**Duties and Responsibilities:**\n\n* Create construction drawings utilizing AutoCAD\n* Ensure all drawings meet applicable engineering standards and client requirements\n* Generate fiber count and bill of material sheets\n * Accurately depict fiber optic route\n * Accurately depict the type, quantity and placement of all materials and equipment\n* Conduct site walks and field verifications\n* Work with construction crews to complete designs\n* Conduct QA/QC on deliverables\n\n**Required Skills:**\n\n* Experience in OSP Fiber Design\n* 5+ years relevant experience\n* AutoCAD experience\n* GIS experience preferred\n* Communication skills\n\n## OSP Designer / Engineer\n\n#### OSP Design\n\n**Duties and Responsibilities:**\n\n* Create permit and construction drawings utilizing AutoCAD or MicroStation\n* Work with clients directly to determine engineering guidelines and specifications\n * Conduct QA/QC reviews\n * Work with permit offices, utilities and other entities\n\n**Required Skills:**\n\n* Experience in OSP Fiber Design\n* 5+ years relevant experience\n* AutoCAD or MicroStation experience\n* Katapult experience\n\n**\n\nTo apply, send a resume to [careers@netpmd.com](mailto:careers@netpmd.com)**"}
