{"url": "https://netpmd.com/design-services","title":"Design Services | NetPMD","markdown":"[Skip to Content](#page)\n\n[NetPMD Design and Integration](/) \n\n[Home](/)\n\n[About](/about)\n\n[Services](#)\n\n[Design Services](/design-services)\n\n[Program Management](/program-management)\n\n[Integration Services](/integration-services)\n\n[Wireless Services](/wireless-services)\n\n[Careers](/careers)\n\n[Contact](/contact)\n\n# Design Services\n\nNetPMD provides OSP design and broadband network design services, including permit and construction drawings using industry-standard tools. Whether you're building fiber-to-the-home networks or upgrading existing infrastructure, our team delivers accurate and timely designs for ISPs, CLECs, ILECs, and MSOs.\n\n## Fiber Optic Design\n\nNetPMD provides Fiber Optic Design services for outside plant (OSP) networks. Our design services cover the planning, engineering, and documentation of fiber optic networks, including fiber-to-the-home (FTTH) networks and other broadband infrastructure. \n\n* **GIS Design**: We use GIS platforms to design fiber optic networks, capturing location data, infrastructure details, and network elements in a geographic information system.\n\n* **Permit Drawing Production**: NetPMD produces permit drawings for submission to regulatory agencies and municipalities. These drawings are essential for obtaining permits to install fiber optic cables and other network equipment in public rights-of-way.\n\n* **Construction Drawing Production**: NetPMD produces construction drawings that provide detailed instructions for installing fiber optic networks. These drawings include placement of cables, conduits, vaults, and other infrastructure elements.\n\n* **AutoCAD Drafting**: NetPMD uses AutoCAD for drafting and creating technical drawings for fiber optic networks.\n\n* **Field Surveys**: NetPMD conducts field surveys to gather data on existing infrastructure and site conditions before initiating design processes.\n\n* **Make Ready Engineering**: NetPMD provides make ready engineering services to support utility pole attachment applications and permitting.\n\n* **One Call and Locates**: NetPMD facilitates one call notifications and utility locate requests to identify buried infrastructure before construction.\n\n* **USIC / Ground Disturbance**: NetPMD coordinates ground disturbance activities, including utility locating and USIC coordination.  \n\n* **Staking Sheets**: NetPMD produces staking sheets for fiber optic deployments.\n\n* **Fiber Optic Splicing**: NetPMD provides fiber optic splicing services for outside plant networks.\n\n* **OTDR Testing**: NetPMD conducts OTDR (Optical Time Domain Reflectometry) testing for fiber optic networks.\n\n* **Network Integration**: NetPMD provides network integration services, including the installation and configuration of optical network equipment.\n\n* **CAD Redlines**: NetPMD provides CAD redline services, incorporating as-built information into design drawings.\n\n* **As-Builts**: NetPMD provides as-built documentation services for fiber optic networks.\n\n\n\n\n\n## Broadband Network Design\n\n* **Broadband Network Design**: NetPMD provides broadband network design services for ISPs, CLECs, ILECs, and MSOs.\n\n* **Network Planning**: NetPMD provides network planning services for broadband networks, including capacity planning, topology design, and technology selection.\n\n* **BEAD Program Support**: NetPMD provides support for clients participating in the Broadband Equity, Access, and Deployment (BEAD) program.\n\n* **Grant Writing**: NetPMD provides grant writing services for clients pursuing broadband funding.\n\n* **Grant Management**: NetPMD provides grant management services for clients receiving broadband funding.\n\n\n\n## Program Management\n\n* **Project Management**: NetPMD provides project management services for telecommunications projects.\n\n* **Right-of-Way / Permitting**: NetPMD provides right-of-way and permitting services for telecommunications projects.\n\n* **Stakeholder Management**: NetPMD provides stakeholder management services for telecommunications projects.\n\n\n\n## Make Ready\n\n* **Make Ready Engineering**: NetPMD provides make ready engineering services to support utility pole attachment applications and permitting.\n\n\n\n## GIS\n\n* **GIS Data Management**: NetPMD provides GIS data management services for telecommunications clients.\n\n* **GIS Design**: NetPMD uses GIS platforms for designing fiber optic networks.\n\n* **As-Built GIS Updates**: NetPMD provides as-built GIS update services for fiber optic networks.\n\n\n\n## Field Services\n\n* **Fiber Splicing**: NetPMD provides fiber splicing services for outside plant networks.\n\n* **OTDR Testing**: NetPMD provides OTDR testing for fiber optic networks.\n\n* **Network Integration**: NetPMD provides network integration services.\n\n* **Drop Installation**: NetPMD provides drop installation services for fiber optic networks.\n\n* **Ground Disturbance**: NetPMD provides ground disturbance services for fiber optic networks.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"}
</tool_response>

